2Ch 33:1 , Manasseh's wicked reign;
2Ch 33:3 , He sets up idolatry, and will not be admonished;
2Ch 33:11 , He is carried into Babylon;
2Ch 33:12 , Upon his prayer to God he is released and puts down idolatry;
2Ch 33:18 , His acts;
2Ch 33:20 , He dying, Amon succeeds him;
2Ch 33:21 , who is slain by his servants;
2Ch 33:25 , The murderers being slain, Josiah succeeds him.
